					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "ON CHANGE\nThe On Change node allows you to convert from signal flow to event flow.\nThe event will update only when there is a change in a value.\nKeep this in mind when deciding which signal you are going to convert.\n\nFor example: converting a collection of oscillator signals to events will cause thousands of events to happen every second.\nThis can affect your performance."
					}
				},
